  "ruleText": "Lot 7102.01 “Cash-out voucher” means a printed receipt tendered to the player, upon request, for any unused plays or winnings that remain on the electronic lucky 7 ticket dispensing device.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Lot 7100) #13068, eff 6-27-20; ss by #13913, eff 3-22-24",
